# Frontend API configuration (Vite reads only VITE_-prefixed variables).
#
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT: leave VITE_API_URL empty. Vite then uses "/api", which is
# proxied to the local backend (http://localhost:5000) by frontend/vite.config.js.
#
# PRODUCTION (Vercel): set VITE_API_URL to your Render backend's API root,
# including the trailing "/api" path. Example:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://your-render-backend-url.onrender.com/api
#
# If it is left empty in production, the app will call "/api" on the Vercel
# domain itself, which does not serve the API and returns "Route not found".
#
# VITE_API_URL=